sequenceDiagram
    participant J as Job coordinator
    participant C as Catalog ledger
    participant G as Provider gateway
    participant P as Approved provider
    participant S as Project store
    J->>C: Verify generation and reserve budget
    C-->>J: Prepared request ID
    J->>G: Request and manifest references
    G->>G: Verify current policy and evidence hashes
    G->>C: Persist dispatch intent
    G->>P: Approved images and text only
    P-->>G: Structured response and usage
    G->>C: Settle usage or retain uncertain reservation
    G->>J: Validated proposed output
    J->>S: Commit if lease, generation and dependencies match
    S-->>J: Proposed revision or stale rejection
    Note over J,S: Arrival never authorizes overwriting the script head
